Package: rbrm
Title: Regularized Binary Regression Models
Version: 0.0.0.1
Authors@R: c(person(given = "Javier", family = "Martinez-Rodriguez", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "javier@example.com")
    )
Description: Fits relative risk regression models for binary outcomes using 
    Richardson-Robins-Wang and Pozza-Kenne-Pagui-Salvan parameterizations. 
    Supports L1-penalized (lasso) estimation with multiple optimization algorithms 
    including FISTA, L-BFGS, and coordinate descent. Provides cross-validation for 
    penalty parameter selection and regularization path computation.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
